Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}啊  天呀  真不敢相信  弟弟你已经结婚了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh my God! I can’t believe my little brother is married!{\r}
